  "definition": "Wage offers are classified as Below-Market (WDR < 0%), Market-Competitive (0% \u2264 WDR \u2264 10%), or Premium (WDR > 10%), indicating how employers position their compensation relative to minimum requirements. Wage information is included in the wage determination data."
